title: 주4_목_2교시_강의실_서은표_영문
---
<<show pyo_idle>>
<<play pyo_sound>>
EunPyo: Hey. You're here, {name()}?
EunPyo: I saved a seat for you.
(EunPyo moves her bag from the seat next to her.)
(I sat down beside her.)
<<show pyo_neg>>
EunPyo: Midterms are next week. Have you been studying much?
{name()}: No... I don't know why I've been so busy lately.
<<choice 주4_목_2교시_강의실_서은표_긍정1_영문 "Yeah, you should take a break." 주4_목_2교시_강의실_서은표_부정1_영문 "But the team can't afford to lose their ace." >>
<<play 서은표_흠>>
<<show pyo_neg2>>
EunPyo: Me too... I’m thinking about taking a break from the soccer club.
===

title: 주4_목_2교시_강의실_서은표_긍정1_영문
---
{name()}: Right, aren't you working too hard?
{name()}: Oh, I saw that you went to a tournament last weekend.
{name()}: It popped up on Star-gram.
<<like 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo +5>>
<<show pyo_blush>>
EunPyo: Oh, that's right.
EunPyo: You remember...
{name()}: I saw the photo of you smiling with the trophy. You looked cute.
<<jump 주4_목_2교시_강의실_서은표_분기1_영문>>
===

title: 주4_목_2교시_강의실_서은표_부정1_영문
---
{name()}: But the team can't afford to lose their ace.
{name()}: I heard you're the absolute star of the team. The rumors are everywhere.
<<like 서은표>>
<<jump 주4_목_2교시_강의실_서은표_분기1_영문>>
===

title: 주4_목_2교시_강의실_서은표_분기1_영문
---
<<like 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo +5>>
<<show pyo_blush>>
<<play 서은표_허>>
EunPyo: I'm not that good...
(EunPyo's face turns visibly red.)
EunPyo: ......
EunPyo: This is embarrassing.
(EunPyo leans her head on my shoulder.)
<<choice 주4_목_2교시_강의실_서은표_긍정2_영문 "Stay still." 주4_목_2교시_강의실_서은표_부정2_영문 "Gently move so EunPyo pulls away." >>
(I can almost feel her warmth.)
===

title: 주4_목_2교시_강의실_서은표_긍정2_영문
---
<<like 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo +5>>
(I stay still so EunPyo can keep leaning on me.)
EunPyo: ...
EunPyo: You smell really nice. Is it perfume...?
{name()}: I'm not wearing any, though.
{name()}: Maybe it's my fabric softener...?
<<show pyo_smile>>
EunPyo: Maybe it's just your natural scent.
(We stayed like that for a moment until the professor walked in and class began.) 
<<end>>

===

title: 주4_목_2교시_강의실_서은표_부정2_영문
---
(I felt a bit uncomfortable with her leaning on me, so I moved slightly to make her pull away.)
<<show pyo_idle>>
EunPyo: ...
EunPyo: I should go to the restroom.
(Not long after EunPyo left, the professor walked in.)
<<end>>
===